    "titleMyanmar": "私の将来の夢と日本留学の計画 (My Future Dream and Study Abroad Plan) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Since childhood, I have had a strong interest in Japanese architecture and design. When I was in high school, reading a book about traditional Japanese wooden architecture inspired my dream of learning authentic building techniques in Japan in the future.\n\nTo make that dream come true, after graduating from university, I am thinking of studying abroad at a Japanese graduate school. Since I am scheduled to enter next April, I am currently studying Japanese for more than four hours every day. In December of this year, I intend to take the JLPT N2. If I pass, I believe I will be able to discuss specialized research more smoothly with Japanese professors.\n\nOf course, living alone in a foreign country causes some anxiety, but I want to overcome various hardships and turn them into valuable experiences. I am firmly determined to become an architect who bridges my home country and Japan in the future."
