    "titleMy": "初めての海外出張の失敗と準備の教訓 (Lessons from Mistakes on My First Overseas Business Trip) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "初めての海外出張の失敗と準備の教訓 (Lessons from Mistakes on My First Overseas Business Trip) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "In the spring of my second year at the company, I was assigned to go on my first solo overseas business trip to Singapore. From a week before departure, I collected and printed English presentation materials to be used in business negotiations in advance. I also bought Japanese souvenirs for local clients beforehand and placed them in my suitcase.\n\nI thought preparations were thorough, but on the morning of departure day, I made a huge mistake. When I tried to check my smartphone on the train heading to the airport, I realized that I had accidentally forgotten my passport at home in the entranceway! Fortunately, because I had left early with plans to arrive at the airport three hours before departure time, I hurried back home by taxi to retrieve the passport and managed to catch the flight in time.\n\nFrom this experience, I deeply felt the importance of pointing and confirming the checklist once more right before departure. It is essential not only to prepare solidly in advance, but also not to let down one's guard until the very last moment of departure."
