    "titleMyanmar": "プレゼン前のUSB忘れと準備 (Forgetting USB Drive Before Presentation) (နားထောင်ခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Senpai: Nakamura, have you finished preparing for today's 2 PM presentation?\nNakamura: Yes, I finished making all the slide materials yesterday.\nSenpai: Have copies of the handouts already been made?\nNakamura: Ah! I hadn't printed them yet. I will make copies right away for the number of meeting room attendees.\nSenpai: Yes, please. And do you have the USB flash drive with the presentation files?\nNakamura: What, no way...! I accidentally left it behind at the company, plugged into the desk computer!\nSenpai: What, really? Don't worry, I saved a backup copy on the cloud server in advance, so we can download it from there.\nNakamura: Really! What a relief that you saved it in advance, Senpai. Thank you so much!"
