    "titleMy": "引っ越しでお世話になった人々への感謝 (Gratitude to the People Who Helped Me Move) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "引っ越しでお世話になった人々への感謝 (Gratitude to the People Who Helped Me Move) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Last Saturday, I moved from an apartment near the university to a new room. I had so much luggage that I couldn't carry it alone, but two classmates from my Japanese language school came to help early in the morning. Thanks to them helping me carry heavy cardboard boxes and the refrigerator, we were able to safely carry all luggage into the room by early afternoon.\n\nAlso, the landlord living next door was a very kind person. Saying \"Congratulations on your move,\" he gave me sweets from a famous local traditional Japanese confectionery shop. Furthermore, he kindly explained in detail about the town's trash separation methods and supermarket special sale days.\n\nI was so delighted by everyone's kindness that I invited the friends who helped to a nearby Western-style restaurant and treated them to a feast in gratitude. It was a day when I truly realized the blessing of having friends who help when in trouble."
