    "titleMy": "学生寮の入寮オリエンテーション (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "学生寮の入寮オリエンテーション (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "International students, welcome to the university dormitory. Because students from various countries live in this dormitory, everyone must obey the established rules so that all can live comfortably.\n\nFirst, regarding room key management: You must not lend your key to others or make duplicate copies. If you lose it, you must report it immediately to the dormitory management office.\n\nNext, about using shared spaces: After using the kitchen gas stove or microwave, you must always clean it up neatly. Also, you must not leave raw garbage out in the hallways. You have to separate garbage and take it out to the collection point on the designated mornings.\n\nFinally, rules regarding visitors: Even if they are friends or family members, you must not let them stay overnight. If they wish to stay overnight, you must reserve the university guest house in advance."
