    "translationMy": "Since coming to Japan, I have been living in Tokyo the entire time. I am often asked: \"What do you think about life in Tokyo?\" I think Tokyo is a very convenient and safe town. There are many trains and subways, so you can go anywhere immediately. I think it is not dangerous even if you walk alone late at night. However, I think commodity prices and apartment rents are a bit expensive. Vegetables and fruit are also more expensive than in my country, so when cooking for myself, I look for times when the supermarket has discounts. Overall, I think Tokyo is a wonderful and comfortable city to live in."
