    "titleMy": "思い出の写真アルバム (Memories Photo Album) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "思い出の写真アルバム (Memories Photo Album) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "On the desk in my room, there is an album of photographs that I took since coming to Japan. The first photograph is of me wearing the traditional kimono that I bought in Kyoto last year. It is very beautiful and I like it a lot. The second one is a photo of the chocolate cake that my friends made for my birthday last month. It had many strawberries on top and was really delicious. The third one is a photo taken together with Teacher Kimura, who always kindly teaches us at Japanese school. The blue sweater that the teacher is wearing was knitted by his wife, he told us. This album is a treasure that makes me remember the precious time I spent in Japan."
