    "titleMyanmar": "我が家への道案内 (Directions to My House) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "To the international students: We are eagerly looking forward to the homestay this Saturday. Here are the directions from the station to our house. When you exit the East Exit of Central Station, the bus stop will be right in front of you. Keeping the bus stop on your right, walk straight down the main street for about 5 minutes. When you cross the intersection with the first traffic light, you will see a convenience store with a blue sign. Please turn left at the corner of that convenience store. If you advance a little along the narrow street, there is a small river and a white bridge. Cross that bridge, and the second house on the immediate right is my house. The landmark is a large cherry tree in front of the entrance. When you get lost on the way, please call us anytime."
